From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:45:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D203 server: importing existing message IDs conflicts with
 409

Upstream: importing a transcript under a new session ID whose message IDs already exist (re-importing an export
under another ID) answers 500 with an empty body: the message insert hits the primary key and dies. Only a
reused session ID was mapped to 409.
Fixed: the import checks the transcript's message IDs before writing and fails with
SessionTransfer.MessageConflictError, answered as 409 ConflictError ("Message already exists: <id>", resource
<id>); nothing is created.
Scenarios: session-api-transfer.test.ts "export a live session and import it elsewhere"
Upstream tests: packages/server/test/session-import.test.ts adds a test

